#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:1
#: 341cbe96e29d4d2d94edd2f238e45fbe
msgid "Joystick teleop"
msgstr "手柄遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:3
#: f566175380a94881881c1b7e65eec890
msgid ""
"A game controller (joystick / gamepad) commands the arms and, in chassis "
"mode, the mobile base. The node is `joystick_teleop` in "
"[`arms_teleop`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md) "
"([arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control))."
msgstr "游戏手柄控制手臂；底盘模式下也控制移动底盘。节点是 [`arms_teleop`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md) 里的 `joystick_teleop`（[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:5
#: 89d22f03e25c41ddb75bd85700f05e1b
msgid "1. Before you start"
msgstr "​1. 开始之前"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:7
#: 4a2486c61b794c6cac9f69315c6d23d3
msgid ""
"The robot stack is already running (mock, Isaac Sim, or real). This "
"launch starts the joystick node on that stack."
msgstr "机器人运控已经在运行（mock、Isaac Sim 或真机）。这次启动在这套运控上拉起手柄节点。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:8
#: 1409e8a8fd1f4a5089ebffd08add2820
msgid "The controller is on `/dev/input/js0`, unless you pass another `joy_dev`."
msgstr "手柄在 `/dev/input/js0` 上。要换设备时传入另一个 `joy_dev`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:10
#: 2facd1783ec5434c8ead1074cd1f088c
msgid "2. Start"
msgstr "​2. 启动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:12
#: 98e886ee9eef40f28d79a70fa1cb0ff0
msgid ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py"
msgstr ""
"source install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:17
#: cfe94c3be6af451ba719ac6d9b5c5b37
msgid ""
"`joy_driver:=auto` picks the driver from `ros2 run joy "
"joy_enumerate_devices`. When that report says `Mapped: true`, the launch "
"uses `game_controller_node` and "
"[`generic_gamepad.yaml`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/config/joy_mapping/generic_gamepad.yaml)"
" (SDL layout: F710, PS4, Xbox, Switch Pro, GameSir). An unmapped device "
"uses `joy_node` and `default.yaml`."
msgstr "`joy_driver:=auto` 按 `ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices` 的结果选驱动。报告里是 `Mapped: true` 时，launch 使用 `game_controller_node` 和 [`generic_gamepad.yaml`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/config/joy_mapping/generic_gamepad.yaml)（SDL 布局：F710、PS4、Xbox、Switch Pro、GameSir）。未映射的设备使用 `joy_node` 和 `default.yaml`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 3c3cd4a60151423abf0ddd5703310d03
msgid ""
"ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1"
"\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py joy_driver:=joy\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py config:=default "
"joy_driver:=joy"
msgstr ""
"ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py joy_driver:=joy\n"
"ros2 launch arms_teleop joystick_teleop.launch.py config:=default "
"joy_driver:=joy"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 06839862b7074d518f5a277525ac9c0e
msgid "Argument"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: c4b5bdecb96946699df82578cfa05dd3
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: f70ec91a6f514af19ccade57a0bd4f2b
msgid "What it selects"
msgstr "选择什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 919114419efe457ea04b7ffe8cca8987
msgid "`joy_driver`"
msgstr "`joy_driver`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 0e92bf9b12d24b2d8c00529ba761f93e 4745423df53847feb52280cb15841d3d
msgid "`auto`"
msgstr "`auto`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 48d0bd892b6d404f8e048fbbc9427292
msgid "`auto`, `game_controller`, or `joy`"
msgstr "`auto`、`game_controller` 或 `joy`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: a56ee603c3854823b24677955375ed5f
msgid "`joy_dev`"
msgstr "`joy_dev`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: f5478b7d99844c83b22dd5141475c5eb
msgid "`/dev/input/js0`"
msgstr "`/dev/input/js0`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 59519117f8b84003bab1165381e08ca3
msgid ""
"Device path (`/dev/input/jsN`). With several controllers, pass this and "
"the launch enumerates that id"
msgstr "设备路径（`/dev/input/jsN`）。接了多只手柄时传入它，launch 按这个 id 枚举"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 810e7aed964e4ffda3066574abc5c792
msgid "`config`"
msgstr "`config`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 232868f0e9af4203be81aff675a0b7f9
msgid "File name under `config/joy_mapping/` (no suffix), or `auto`"
msgstr "`config/joy_mapping/` 下的文件名（不带后缀），或 `auto`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:32
#: f98c67d2e47141ecadc4118f83d3a944
msgid ""
"`config:=auto` follows the same mapped / unmapped split: "
"`generic_gamepad` or `default`. On an F710, X and D share "
"`generic_gamepad.yaml` under `game_controller_node`. With "
"`joy_driver:=joy`, use `default.yaml` and restart the launch after you "
"flip the mode switch."
msgstr "`config:=auto` 按同一套已映射 / 未映射来分：`generic_gamepad` 或 `default`。F710 的 X 档和 D 档在 `game_controller_node` 下共用 `generic_gamepad.yaml`。改成 `joy_driver:=joy` 时用 `default.yaml`，拨动模式开关后重新启动这次 launch。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:34
#: 9754daf1e38a40cc89338c7c2b6b0506
msgid ""
"For an unmapped device, echo `/joy`, note the button and axis indices, "
"and add a YAML under `config/joy_mapping/`. Start with `config:=<name>`."
msgstr "设备未映射时，echo `/joy`，记下按键和轴的序号，在 `config/joy_mapping/` 下加一份 YAML。启动时写 `config:=<name>`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:36
#: d92ef5de37d64496acaabed923aec581
msgid ""
"On a lean branch, the `quick_start.sh` assist menu can start this launch."
" One controller starts on its own; several controllers ask for the device"
" id and pass `joy_dev`."
msgstr "在精简分支上，`quick_start.sh` 的辅助菜单可以启动这次 launch。一只手柄会直接启动；多只手柄会询问设备 id，并传入 `joy_dev`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:38
#: fb042ec38f5b422c9062f5f69f3785df
msgid ""
"Leave `keyboard_teleop` stopped while `joystick_teleop` is publishing "
"`control_input` and `/cmd_vel`. Both nodes write those topics."
msgstr "`joystick_teleop` 正在发布 `control_input` 和 `/cmd_vel` 时，让 `keyboard_teleop` 保持停止。两个节点都会写这些话题。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:40
#: 6980c50bb00145eb8834cfcfae70229f
msgid "3. Buttons"
msgstr "​3. 按键"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:42
#: af22fe5c2dc948c3a410bd6fb8e7a4c5
msgid ""
"Teleop starts disabled. Press the **right stick** to enable it, then move"
" the sticks. Press the right stick again to disable."
msgstr "遥操作启动时是关闭的。按下**右摇杆**打开，再拨动摇杆。再按一次右摇杆则关闭。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 260226842e0a44edb761ceb83ac2c636
msgid "Control"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 9a39fad6e7984e5689c70b73f1e5a74e
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: cfdd4ad9bd744db68568548fdedd4e4c
msgid "**RB**"
msgstr "**RB**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/9-joystick_teleop.md:19
#: 5caf921bf4744b59a0b6bdcdc1eb91a5
