msgid ""
"With one supported pedal and an empty namespace, `ros2 run arms_teleop "
"foot_pedal_teleop` is enough; the status topic is then "
"`/teleop/mode_state`. The event map (FSM up/down, left/right arm teleop, "
"STORAGE/UPDATE, mirror), udev, and how to pick a device when several "
"pedals are connected are in the [package README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)."
" Mode fields are on {ref}`Teleop topics and data <teleop-topics-and-"
"data>`."
msgstr "只接了一块受支持的脚踏板、且命名空间为空时，`ros2 run arms_teleop foot_pedal_teleop` 即可；此时状态话题是 `/teleop/mode_state`。事件表（FSM 上/下、左右臂遥操、STORAGE/UPDATE、镜像）、udev，以及接了多块脚踏板时如何选设备，在[软件包 README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。模式字段在 {ref}`遥操相关话题与数据说明 <teleop-topics-and-data>`。"

