#~ msgid ""
#~ "By default `joy_driver:=auto` uses "
#~ "`game_controller_node` when `joy_enumerate_devices` "
#~ "reports the device as mapped, with "
#~ "`generic_gamepad.yaml` (SDL standard layout). "
#~ "Unmapped devices fall back to `joy_node`"
#~ " and `default.yaml`. The package README "
#~ "lists typical mapped gamepads; do not"
