#~ msgstr "列出已连接的设备："

#~ msgid "ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices"
#~ msgstr "ros2 run joy joy_enumerate_devices"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If more than one controller is "
#~ "connected, pass the device you want, "
#~ "for example `joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1`. Mapping "
#~ "overrides and keyboard teleop are in "
#~ "the [package README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
#~ "sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md). "
#~ "Do not run `joystick_teleop` and "
#~ "`keyboard_teleop` at the same time if"
#~ " they would publish to the same "
#~ "topics."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果接了不止一个手柄，传入你要用的设备，例如 `joy_dev:=/dev/input/js1`。映射覆盖和键盘遥操作见 "
#~ "[软件包 README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
#~ "sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_teleop/README.md)。如果 "
#~ "`joystick_teleop` 和 `keyboard_teleop` "
#~ "会往同一组话题发布，不要同时运行。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The joystick node publishes `control_input`"
#~ " (`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`) and `teleop_mode`"
#~ " (`arms_ros2_control_msgs/TeleopMode`). `arms_target_manager`"
#~ " scales `control_input` into `left_target/twist`"
#~ " and `right_target/twist`. In chassis mode"
#~ " the node publishes `/cmd_vel`. The "
#~ "joystick also publishes `/fsm_command`. The"
#~ " keyboard node publishes the same "
#~ "`control_input` and `teleop_mode` pair, and"
#~ " it does not publish `/fsm_command`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "手柄节点发布 `control_input`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/Inputs`）和 "
#~ "`teleop_mode`（`arms_ros2_control_msgs/TeleopMode`）。`arms_target_manager`"
#~ " 把 `control_input` 换算成 `left_target/twist` "
#~ "和 `right_target/twist`。底盘模式下该节点发布 `/cmd_vel`。手柄还会发布 "
#~ "`/fsm_command`。键盘节点发布同一对 `control_input` 和 "
#~ "`teleop_mode`，不发布 `/fsm_command`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`teleop_mode` is the status for this "
#~ "path. QoS is `Reliable` + "
#~ "`TransientLocal`: one message at startup, "
#~ "then another when active, control mode,"
#~ " mirror, or speed changes. Switching "
#~ "the active arm does not republish "
#~ "it. The arm is `Inputs.target` (`1` "
#~ "left, `2` right). If the joystick "
#~ "pauses `Inputs` in chassis mode, keep"
#~ " the last `target`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`teleop_mode` 是这条路径的反馈。QoS 为 `Reliable` + "
#~ "`TransientLocal`：启动发一次，激活状态、控制模式、镜像或速度变化时再发。切换当前臂不会因此再发。当前臂是 "
#~ "`Inputs.target`（`1` 左，`2` 右）。手柄在底盘模式下如果暂停了 "
#~ "`Inputs`，请保留最近一次 `target`。"

